    Mindustry rebrand: exclude Minecraft-resource-market pages/VMs from the build.
    Source files stay on disk so they can be diffed/restored, but XAML compilation
    and code compilation skip them so nothing references CurseForge/Modrinth UI.
  -->
  <ItemGroup>
